                "content": "{{Item Infobox\n|id          = 301003\n|title       = W-Engine Energy Module\n|image       = Item W-Engine Energy Module.png\n|type        = W-Engine EXP Material\n|category    = Material\n|rarity      = A\n|effect      = Provides 3,000 EXP for a W-Engine.\n|description = A high-efficiency energy module made of various Etheric matter, providing stable and long-lasting energy for all models of W-Engines.\n|source1     = [[Combat Simulation]]: [[W-Engine Specialization]]\n|source2     = [[Signal Shop]]\n|source3     = [[Event]] Reward\n|source4     = [[New Eridu City Fund]]\n}}\n{{Description|A high-efficiency energy module made of various Etheric matter, providing stable and long-lasting energy for all models of W-Engines.}}\n'''W-Engine Energy Module''' is an Enhancement Material for [[W-Engine]]s that provides 3,000 [[W-Engine EXP Material#EXP Table|W-Engine EXP]].\n\nIt can be obtained through [[Combat Simulation]]: [[W-Engine Specialization]], [[Signal Shop]], [[Event]]s and the [[New Eridu City Fund]].\n\n==Other Languages==\n{{Other Languages\n|en       = W-Engine Energy Module\n|zhs      = 音擎能源模块\n|zhs_rm   = \n|zht      = 音擎能源模組\n|zht_rm   = \n|ja       = 音動機用エネルギーモジュール\n|ja_rm    = \n|ko       = W-엔진 에너지 모듈\n|es       = Módulo de energía\n|fr       = Module énergétique de moteur-ampli\n|ru       = Энергомодуль амплификатора\n|th       = W-Engine Energy Module\n|vi       = Mô Đun Năng Lượng W-Engine\n|de       = W-Motor-Energiemodul\n|id       = W-Engine Energy Module\n|pt       = Módulo de Energia de Motor-W\n}}\n\n==Change History==\n{{Change History|1.0}}\n\n==Navigation==\n{{Upgrade Item Navbox|W-Engine Materials}}\n\n[[vi:Mô Đun Năng Lượng W-Engine]]"
